4. Important Functions
Function	Meaning
pthread_create()	Creates thread
pthread_join()	Waits for thread
sem_init()	Initializes semaphore
sem_wait()	Decreases semaphore / waits
sem_post()	Increases semaphore
pthread_mutex_lock()	Locks shared resource
pthread_mutex_unlock()	Unlocks shared resource
sleep()	Pauses execution
sem_destroy()	Destroys semaphore

5. Compile and Run
gcc producer.c -o producer -pthread
./producer


Main concept: Producer adds items, Consumer removes items, Semaphore manages empty/full spaces, and Mutex protects the shared buffer.
